exports[`money and snapshots > policyUpdated plain text matches snapshot 1`] = `
"We're updating our Privacy Policy on 1 November 2026

Zudomart

ACTION NEEDED
Changes to our Privacy Policy
=============================

Hi Amaka, we've rewritten our Privacy Policy to be clearer about how we use your information to keep orders safe and personalise your feed.

What's changing
- We explain how escrow and payment partners process your payment details.
- New section on how recommendations use what you watch and save, and how to turn it off.
- Retention periods are now listed per type of data.
- Clearer steps to download or delete your data.

Policy: Privacy Policy
Effective: 1 November 2026

[Please review and accept] These are significant changes, so we need your agreement. You'll be asked to accept the next time you open Zudomart on or after 1 November 2026.

Review and accept: https://zudomart.com/legal/accept?doc=privacy

Read the full Privacy Policy: https://zudomart.com/legal/privacy

--
